    <bpmn:process id="W_W3714" name="W3714. Code of Conduct, Ethics Policy &amp; Standards Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Policy cycle; regulatory change; case learning
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Code of Conduct and ethics policy suite
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Legal (links to VS-100.3), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), ABC (links to VS-86.3), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Communications (links to VS-14.3/VS-103.2), Records (links to VS-88)
Source: workflow W3714 — Code of Conduct, Ethics Policy &amp; Standards Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3714_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3714_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3714_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3714_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3714_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3714_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3714_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3714_Start3" name="Policy cycle; regulatory change; case learning">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3714_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3714_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Legal maintain the Code of Conduct and ethics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Legal maintain the Code of Conduct and ethics policy suite: anti-bribery/corruption, conflicts of interest, gifts &amp; entertainment, fraud &amp; asset-protection, harassment/discrimination/respect, safety &amp; environmental conduct, consumer/data protection, vendor integrity, and the speak-up/whistleblower policy with protection guarantees
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal / HR
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3714_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3714_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3714_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage policy alignment across the program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage policy alignment across the program: integrate to ABC policy (links to VS-86.3/W2943), HR conduct policy (links to VS-19), data-privacy (links to VS-91), consumer protection (links to VS-22), and the internal-controls matrix; manage policy versioning and publication (links to VS-88)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3714_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3714_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3714_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer refresh policy from case learning (W3728) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer refresh policy from case learning (W3728) and regulatory change (links to VS-22.3), communicate changes enterprise-wide (links to W3718), and attest employee acknowledgment (links to VS-19.4 training/attestation)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / HR / Communications
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3714_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3714_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3714_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3714_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
