        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-586 (ensure controlled execution — Ethics Governance, Speak-Up Channel &amp; Intake Operations (PA-119.1).) | - operational: case-driven refresh; operational: attestation and training (W3718)
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
