    <bpmn:process id="W_W3715" name="W3715. Speak-Up Channel Operations &amp; Multi-Channel Intake" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporter contacts a channel
Frequency: Continuous (intake as reports arrive)
Volume: Report volume across the workforce (~6,932 + contingent + vendors)
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Speak-Up Intake
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Speak-Up Intake team, third-party hotline vendor (links to W3720), HR (links to VS-103.1), IT (links to VS-27), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Cross-Entity (links to VS-72)
Source: workflow W3715 — Speak-Up Channel Operations &amp; Multi-Channel Intake</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3715_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3715_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3715_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3715_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3715_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3715_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3715_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3715_Start3" name="Reporter contacts a channel">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3715_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3715_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer operate multi-channel intake: 24/7 third-party…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer operate multi-channel intake: 24/7 third-party hotline (phone/SMS), web-portal, email, mobile-app form, and in-person to HR/Ethics/LP — available to employees, contractors, vendors, customers, and the public; ensure language accessibility (Filipino/English) and channel awareness (links to W3718)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Intake / Vendor
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3715_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3715_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3715_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Intake capture each report: the allegation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Intake capture each report: the allegation (who/what/when/where), category, evidence, reporter preference (named/anonymous/confidential), and risk/urgency; create the case record (links to W3717) with strict need-to-know access
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Intake
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per report</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3715_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3715_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3715_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer acknowledge the report to the reporter (where…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer acknowledge the report to the reporter (where possible) within SLA, confirm protection (W3716), and route to triage (W3717); manage intake quality and channel-performance with the vendor (links to W3720)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Intake
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per report</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3715_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3715_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3715_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3715_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3715_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-586 (ensure controlled execution — Ethics Governance, Speak-Up Channel &amp; Intake Operations (PA-119.1).) | - operational: anonymity (W3716) and independence; operational: multi-channel + language
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Speak-Up Intake</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
