    <bpmn:process id="W_W3716" name="W3716. Whistleblower Anonymity, Confidentiality &amp; Protection Framework" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Report intake (W3715); retaliation concern; protection need
Frequency: Per report + maintained framework
Volume: All reports and reporters
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Legal (links to VS-100.3), HR (links to VS-19/VS-84), IT/Security (links to VS-27.3), LP (links to VS-23), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3716 — Whistleblower Anonymity, Confidentiality &amp; Protection Framework</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3716_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3716_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3716_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3716_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3716_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3716_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3716_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3716_Start3" name="Report intake (W3715); retaliation concern; protection need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3716_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3716_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Legal maintain the whistleblower protection…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Legal maintain the whistleblower protection framework: anonymity option (where law/policy allows), strict confidentiality/need-to-know, anti-retaliation policy and guarantees, protection measures (interim reassignment, monitoring), and the legal basis (RA 11032 anti-red tape, SEC governance code, and contractual/ethical protection)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3716_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3716_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3716_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/IT ensure technical confidentiality: secure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/IT ensure technical confidentiality: secure case-management access controls, anonymization of reporter identity where requested, audit trail, and data-protection (links to VS-91/VS-27.3) so reporter identity cannot be exposed
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / IT / Security
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Maintained + per report</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3716_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3716_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3716_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/HR/Legal monitor for retaliation (links to W3725)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/HR/Legal monitor for retaliation (links to W3725) and act on any retaliation against a reporter/witness/investigator; report protection posture and retaliation incidents to the Ethics Committee (W3719) and board audit committee (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / HR / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3716_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3716_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3716_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3716_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3716_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-586 (ensure controlled execution — Ethics Governance, Speak-Up Channel &amp; Intake Operations (PA-119.1).) | - operational: confidentiality controls; operational: anti-retaliation policy and monitoring (W3725)
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
