    <bpmn:process id="W_W3717" name="W3717. Report Triage, Classification &amp; Routing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New report (W3715)
Frequency: Per report
Volume: All reports
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Legal (links to VS-100.3), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), ABC/AML (links to VS-86), LP (links to VS-23), Audit (links to VS-21), Risk (links to VS-21.2), IT/Security (links to VS-27.3)
Source: workflow W3717 — Report Triage, Classification &amp; Routing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3717_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3717_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3717_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3717_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
