      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3717_Start3" name="New report (W3715)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3717_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3717_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer triage each report: classify by violation type…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer triage each report: classify by violation type (ABC, fraud/theft, harassment/discrimination, safety/environmental, consumer/data, conflict, vendor-integrity, other), assess credibility, severity, urgency, and risk; determine the investigation track and the independent investigator
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per report</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3717_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3717_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3717_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer route the case: ABC → ABC track (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer route the case: ABC → ABC track (links to W2943/VS-86) within the program; fraud/theft → LP/audit (links to VS-23/VS-21) with ethics oversight; harassment/HR-conduct → HR-investigation (links to VS-19/VS-84) with ethics oversight where independence needed; safety/environmental → HSE (links to VS-24); serious matters → Legal/Ethics-led (links to W3721)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per report</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3717_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3717_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3717_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage conflicts of interest in routing (recuse…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage conflicts of interest in routing (recuse where the accused is in the reporting chain), assign case ownership, set the investigation SLA, and open the case in case-management (links to W3720); notify the Ethics Committee of high-severity cases (links to W3719)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per report</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3717_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3717_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3717_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3717_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
