    <bpmn:process id="W_W3718" name="W3718. Ethics Awareness, Training &amp; Culture Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Onboarding; annual cycle; case learning; policy change
Frequency: Annual + onboarding + on change
Volume: ~6,932 employees + contingent + key vendors
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / HR-L&amp;D
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, HR/L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4/VS-103), Communications (links to VS-14.3/VS-103.2), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Legal (links to VS-100.3), ABC (links to VS-86.3)
Source: workflow W3718 — Ethics Awareness, Training &amp; Culture Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3718_LaneSet2">
