      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3718_Start3" name="Onboarding; annual cycle; case learning; policy change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3718_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3718_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/HR-L&amp;D deliver ethics awareness and training: Code…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/HR-L&amp;D deliver ethics awareness and training: Code of Conduct training at onboarding and annually, role-based training (cash-handling, procurement, B2G sales, AP for ABC risk), scenario-based learning, and the speak-up channel how-to (how/where to report, protection guarantees)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / HR-L&amp;D / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual + onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3718_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3718_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3718_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Communications run the culture and awareness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Communications run the culture and awareness program: leadership tone-from-the-top messaging, visible channel promotion (posters at 200 stores/DCs, digital channels), and integrity storytelling; measure awareness and trust (links to W3731)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Communications
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3718_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3718_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3718_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage training attestation/completion (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage training attestation/completion (links to VS-19.4), track awareness KPIs, and refresh content from case learning (W3728) and policy change (W3714); report to governance (links to W3719/VS-36)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / HR
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3718_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3718_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3718_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3718_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
