    <bpmn:process id="W_W3720" name="W3720. Speak-Up Vendor/Platform &amp; Records Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor selection/management; case lifecycle; records need
Frequency: Ongoing + per case
Volume: Third-party hotline/intake vendor; case records
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / IT
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, IT (links to VS-27/VS-99), Procurement (links to VS-34), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Records (links to VS-88), Data Privacy (links to VS-91), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3720 — Speak-Up Vendor/Platform &amp; Records Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3720_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3720_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3720_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3720_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3720_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3720_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3720_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3720_Start3" name="Vendor selection/management; case lifecycle; records need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3720_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3720_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Procurement select and manage the third-party…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Procurement select and manage the third-party speak-up hotline/intake vendor and the internal case-management platform: due diligence (security, data-privacy, confidentiality, Philippine data-residency per RA 10173), SLA, and contract (links to VS-34/VS-91)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Procurement / IT
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per vendor + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3720_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3720_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3720_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/IT operate the case-management platform: secure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/IT operate the case-management platform: secure case records, access controls/need-to-know, audit trail, evidence repository, workflow (intake→triage→investigation→closure), and integration to HR/LP/Legal systems where appropriate
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / IT
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3720_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3720_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3720_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Records manage case records retention and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Records manage case records retention and legal-hold (links to VS-88.2), support e-discovery and audit (links to VS-21/VS-88.3), and ensure secure disposition per retention and data-privacy rules (links to VS-91)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Records / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3720_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3720_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3720_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3720_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3720_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-586 (ensure controlled execution — Ethics Governance, Speak-Up Channel &amp; Intake Operations (PA-119.1).) | - operational: due diligence and contract; operational: data-residency requirement
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / IT</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
